     "look": "you"
    }
   },
   "speaker": "capy"
  },
  {
   "text": "You live in Hessdalen. A quiet valley in Norway. Population: tiny.",
   "key": [
    "NORWAY."
   ],
   "board": [
    "HESSDALEN",
    "NORWAY"
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "wide",
    "on": "you"
   },
   "act": {
    "you": {
     "mood": "neutral",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "camera"
    },
    "farmer": {
     "mood": "neutral",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "you"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Around nineteen eighty one, the lights get busy. Really busy.",
   "cap": "Around 1981, the lights get busy. Really busy.",
   "key": [
    "BUSY."
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "medium",
    "on": "farmer"
   },
   "act": {
    "farmer": {
     "mood": "worried",
     "action": "point",
     "look": "camera"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Sometimes many times a week. White. Yellow. Red. Bright as headlights.",
   "key": [
    "RED."
   ],
   "board": [
    "WHITE",
    "YELLOW RED"
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "close",
    "on": "you"
   },
   "act": {
    "you": {
     "mood": "worried",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "camera"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Some just float there. For up to an hour. Just hovering.",
   "key": [
    "HOUR."
   ],
   "place": {
    "capy": [
     -2.2,
     0.6
    ],
    "you": [
     0.6,
     0
    ]
   },
   "shot": {
    "type": "two",
    "on": "capy",
    "with": "you"
   },
   "act": {
    "capy": {
     "mood": "shocked",
     "action": "talk",
     "look": "camera"
    },
    "you": {
     "mood": "shocked",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "capy"
    }
   },
   "speaker": "capy"
  },
  {
   "text": "Others shoot across the valley. Way too fast. Then they vanish.",
   "key": [
    "FAST."
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "low",
    "on": "farmer"
   },
   "act": {
    "farmer": {
     "mood": "shocked",
     "action": "idle"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Not planes. Not cars. Not the moon. Not swamp gas.",
   "key": [
    "MOON."
   ],
   "place": {
    "capy": [
     0,
     1.2
    ],
    "you": [
     -2.6,
     -0.4
    ],
    "farmer": [
     2.8,
     -1.0
    ]
   },
   "shot": {
    "type": "medium",
    "on": "capy"
   },
   "act": {
    "capy": {
     "mood": "smug",
     "action": "talk",
     "look": "camera"
    },
    "you": {
     "mood": "worried",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "capy"
    },
    "farmer": {
     "mood": "worried",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "capy"
    }
   },
   "speaker": "capy"
  },
  {
   "text": "Your quiet valley becomes a tourist spot. For believers. Bring snacks.",
   "key": [
    "BELIEVERS."
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "close",
    "on": "capy"
   },
   "act": {
    "capy": {
     "mood": "smug",
     "action": "cross",
     "look": "camera"
    }
   },
   "speaker": "capy"
  },
  {
   "text": "In nineteen eighty three, scientists start a project. Finally.",
   "cap": "In 1983, scientists start a project. Finally.",
   "key": [
    "PROJECT."
   ],
   "set": "office",
   "setOpts": {
    "boardText": [
     "PROJECT",
     "HESSDALEN"
    ]
   },
   "place": {
    "sci": [
     0,
     -1.0
    ],
    "capy": false,
    "you": false,
    "farmer": false
   },
   "shot": {
    "type": "medium",
    "on": "sci"
   },
   "act": {
    "sci": {
     "mood": "happy",
     "action": "hold",
     "look": "camera"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "They bring cameras. Radar. Instruments that detect radio signals. Lots of patience.",
   "key": [
    "RADAR."
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "close",
    "on": "sci"
   },
   "act": {
    "sci": {
     "mood": "happy",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "camera"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Later, a robot station watches the valley. Nonstop.",
   "key": [
    "STATION"
   ],
   "place": {
    "capy": [
     -2.4,
     0.8
    ]
   },
   "shot": {
    "type": "two",
    "on": "capy",
    "with": "sci"
   },
   "act": {
    "capy": {
     "mood": "neutral",
     "action": "talk",
     "look": "camera"
    },
    "sci": {
     "mood": "neutral",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "capy"
    }
   },
   "speaker": "capy"
  },
  {
   "text": "Do they catch the lights? Yes. On camera. Plenty of times.",
   "key": [
    "CAMERA."
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "medium",
    "on": "sci"
   },
   "act": {
    "sci": {
     "mood": "shocked",
     "action": "point",
     "look": "camera"
    }
   },
   "sfx": [
    [
     0.5,
     "hit"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Do they explain them? Not completely. Not even close.",
   "key": [
    "COMPLETELY."
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "close",
    "on": "capy"
   },
   "act": {
    "capy": {
     "mood": "smug",
     "action": "idle",
     "look": "camera"
    }
   },
   "speaker": "capy"
  },
  {
   "text": "One idea: burning dust from the valley rocks.",
   "key": [
    "DUST"
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "medium",
    "on": "sci"
   },
   "act": {
    "sci": {
     "mood": "neutral",
     "action": "talk",
     "look": "camera"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Another: glowing gas, charged by the ground.",
   "key": [
    "GLOWING"
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "low",
    "on": "sci"
   },
   "act": {
    "sci": {
     "mood": "confused",
     "action": "shrug",
     "look": "camera"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Your science team is still working on it. Decades later. No rush.",
   "key": [
    "DECADES"
   ],
   "shot": {
    "type": "two",
    "on": "capy",
    "with": "sci"
   },
   "act": {
    "capy": {
     "mood": "smug",
     "action": "talk",
     "look": "camera"
    },
    "sci": {
     "mood": "sad",
     "action": "slump"
    }
   },
   "speaker": "capy"
  },
  {
   "text": "Some nights, the lights still show up. Without warning.",
   "key": [
    "NIGHTS,"
